  "_class": "class (0.00258, a draft under study — the simulator's --hero): heavyName = the heavy button's label (the developer's names: Go Feral, Last Rites); hpMult / dmgMult / armorMult scale the knight's derived max HP, damage and armor (gear included); potionHealMult a potion's heal; dodge adds to the relics' dodge (under player.dodgeCap); heavyCd the heavy's cooldown in ordinary turns (relics and Quicken lower it); heavyMult a factor on combat.heavyMult; heavy = what the heavy button does: blow (the knight's, with spill and OVERKILL) | cleave (the blow, and cleaveShare of it on every other foe) | fireball (the blow on every foe; charges per fight) | drain (the blow heals drainShare of it) | mark (a hit that marks the target: every hit on it crits) | censer (a hit, and a blight stack on every foe: blightShare of your damage a stack a turn) | wildshape (a hit, then wildTurns of wildMult damage with no potions); passives: rage = up to this share more damage at no HP, thrallShare = a kill raises a thrall of this share of its max HP that takes the foes' blows first, mend = this share of max HP healed a turn, potionArmor = armor a potion adds for the room; markCrit = crit damage added to every hit on the hexed foe (the hexhunter); chargeOnKill = charges a kill gives back, up to charges (the wizard). Quicken at a shrine gives a charge class a charge instead of cutting its cooldown (run/shrine.js). Every key is present on every hero (0 = off)."
